00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:52.643
- They were great.
- Oh.

00:06:52.643 --> 00:06:53.476
- Olga?

00:06:53.476 --> 00:06:55.451
- They were fabulous.

00:06:55.451 --> 00:06:56.590
- The three maids.

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:57.850
- The maids, they had the--

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.130
- Yeah, they were amazing.

00:06:59.130 --> 00:06:59.963
- Yeah.

00:06:59.963 --> 00:07:01.170
- Did you guys get to
play around with any,

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:02.003
I mean you guys get kinda--

00:07:02.003 --> 00:07:03.363
