00:07:05.773 --> 00:07:06.712
- I was gonna say--

00:07:06.712 --> 00:07:07.545
- Yeah.

00:07:07.545 --> 00:07:08.784
- For a long period of time.

00:07:08.784 --> 00:07:10.720
- I had some blood, but
that was the extent of it.

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:11.830
