00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:18.285
- Yeah.

00:07:18.285 --> 00:07:19.118
- Oh.

00:07:19.118 --> 00:07:19.951
So who got dowsed in it the most?

00:07:19.951 --> 00:07:21.580
I guess you, yeah.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.893
What was that day like?

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:24.789
- Delicious.

00:07:24.789 --> 00:07:26.355
(laughing)

00:07:26.355 --> 00:07:27.290
